se a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/evcohen/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/master/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","'setOptions' is assigned a value but never used.","no-sequences","Unexpected use of comma operator.","SequenceExpression","unexpectedCommaExpression","'Link' is defined but never used.","array-callback-return","Array.prototype.map() expects a return value from arrow function.","ArrowFunctionExpression","expectedInside","React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'prodQuantity' and 'prodTitle'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["290"],"react/jsx-no-duplicate-props","No duplicate props allowed","JSXAttribute","no-whitespace-before-property","Unexpected whitespace before property then.","MemberExpression","unexpectedWhitespace",{"range":"291","text":"292"},{"range":"293","text":"292"},"jsx-a11y/img-redundant-alt","Redundant alt attribute. Screen-readers already announce `img` tags as an image. You don’t need to use the words `image`, `photo,` or `picture` (or any specified custom words) in the alt prop.","React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'history'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["294"],{"desc":"295","fix":"296"},{"desc":"297","fix":"298"},[734,737],".",[576,579],{"desc":"299","fix":"300"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [amount, quantity, title, url]",{"range":"301","text":"302"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [prodQuantity, prodTitle]",{"range":"303","text":"304"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [history]",{"range":"305","text":"306"},[1393,1398],"[amount, quantity, title, url]",[1203,1205],"[prodQuantity, prodTitle]",[264,266],"[history]"]